        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-24T10:02:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Haha yeah, right after Shattered Timelines came out I deliberately played against Lilian in the Wasteland to see if we could get that to happen. Got super-lucky on the environment cards that came out in that if I remember rightly, the first thing out was a Horrid Skunk Ape, followed by Unforgiving Wasteland, followed by the Library and the Bunker (can't remember which way round). By the time something else came out we were pretty much done - the only target left in Lilian's deck by the end was a Carrion Fields we'd destroyed earlier in the game. Everything else was gone and she didn't have time to Horrid Cacophony much of our stuff away because she just got utterly destroyed by hero damage :D.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
